Description: PsychoPy plugin for the Radboud Buttonbox
 This plugin for the PsychoPy experiment builder makes the Radboud
 Buttonbox (BITSI) a device of PsychoPy's Button Box and Sound Sensor
 components, and adds components that send stimulus synchronization
 triggers and control commands, through the RuSocSci package.
